{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8xOTkwLS1CZWZvcmUvRGhhbndhYW4lMjAlMjgxOTkzJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Dhanwaan","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2yTrIWebxujr8PX21RU7bigqLW9.jpg","description":"Kashinath (Ajay Devgn) and Imli (Manisha Koirala) are childhood sweethearts and everyone expects them to marry. Then comes rich, wealthy, and sickly Anjali Chopra (Karisma Kapoor) into Kashinath's life, and then everything changes. Anjali gives up on her sickliness and becomes bold, thanks to Kashinath's care. Anjali falls in love with Kashinath, and boldly tells her dad, Manmohan Chopra (Dalip Tahil), that she will only marry Kashinath. But her dad wants her to wed Ajit (Avinash Wadhawan). Imli reveals her secret that she has heart disease, and if not treated, she will die. Kashinath, unaware of Anjali's affections must find the money to save his true love. What sacrifices will he have to make in order to achieve this?\n\nReleased 10 Dec 1993 · India · Language: Hindi · 143 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"1993","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Romance","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.3","runtime":"143 min","cast":["Ajay Devgn","Manisha Koirala","Karisma Kapoor","Avinash Wadhavan","Aruna Irani","Dalip Tahil","Tinnu Anand","Shakti Kapoor"],"director":["K. Viswanath"],"released":"1993-12-10T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"K. Viswanath","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xV2uf0Vrl8vODySAAwRjp58nbpY.jpg"},{"name":"Ajay Devgn","character":"Kashinath","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vnHQQFzTjJ0sv14DGMIoKa3qTxN.jpg"},{"name":"Manisha Koirala","character":"Imli","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4rwOqhuFOXTPJUJsjutiJ0EjTqY.jpg"},{"name":"Karisma Kapoor","character":"Anjali Chopra","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vaa4dSmayH71krkgnECXQsPaRre.jpg"},{"name":"Avinash Wadhavan","character":"Ajit"},{"name":"Aruna Irani","character":"Kashinath's Mother",